      <activity id="0049da5b-35b2-5c77-a06e-9768c9266337" activityNameId="78f48f81-a7b0-5aeb-a81a-f358b36f9ed2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">EKG I, sanitary facilities, residental building, construction</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: EKG I, sanitary facilities, residental building, construction
Sanitäranlagen Wohnen;
UUID: 8effe812-32de-3928-947c-6d441ce6a91f
This data set includes the material use for the manufacturing of the sanitary installations in the residental building according to Klingler and Kasser, 2011. The warm water production is not part of this data set. A washing machine and dryer are included. No kitchen equipment other than the sink are considered. 4 newly constructed multi-familiy residental buildings. The sanitary system has a life-span of 30 years. Transport is included. The average energy reference area ist 1293 m2.
Location: Data for Zurich, Switzerland
Technology: Average technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8effe812-32de-3928-947c-6d441ce6a91f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
